      "part": "open",
      "kit": "dj",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Late polka, everybody. Softer oom.",
          "startMs": 35
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Gentler pah.",
          "startMs": 3345
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dj-body-01",
      "category": "dj",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/dj-body-01.mp3",
      "durationMs": 8828,
      "overMusic": true,
      "part": "body",
      "kit": "dj",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "The Left Hand Band have a new single out! It's played entirely with left hands, which over here is both of them!",
          "startMs": 35
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Both of them!",
          "startMs": 7212
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dj-body-02",
      "category": "dj",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/dj-body-02.mp3",
      "durationMs": 8657,
      "overMusic": true,
      "part": "body",
      "kit": "dj",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "A note for table nine. Your reflection has ordered dessert. You haven't. One of you is going to have to pay for that.",
          "startMs": 35
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "It's you.",
          "startMs": 7311
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dj-body-03",
      "category": "dj",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/dj-body-03.mp3",
      "durationMs": 10659,
      "overMusic": true,
      "part": "body",
      "kit": "dj",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Accordion Inverted are in the ballroom tonight! Their accordion breathes in when everyone else's breathes out. It makes the whole room very calm.",
          "startMs": 35
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Very calm.",
          "startMs": 9133
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dj-body-04",
      "category": "dj",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/dj-body-04.mp3",
      "durationMs": 11962,
      "overMusic": true,
      "part": "body",
      "kit": "dj",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Fun fact! The tuba player has never once been in time with himself, and he's won three awards for it!",
          "startMs": 35
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Four awards.",
          "startMs": 6237
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Three, Ynnhoj.",
          "startMs": 7991
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "One of them's on my side.",
          "startMs": 9567
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dj-body-05",
      "category": "dj",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/dj-body-05.mp3",
      "durationMs": 9805,
      "overMusic": true,
      "part": "body",
      "kit": "dj",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Somebody asked if Ynnhoj and I ever argue. Never! We agree on everything!",
          "startMs": 35
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Everything.",
          "startMs": 5464
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Nearly everything.",
          "startMs": 7338
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Ynnhoj.",
          "startMs": 9011
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dj-body-06",
      "category": "dj",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/dj-body-06.mp3",
      "durationMs": 9707,
      "overMusic": true,
      "part": "body",
      "kit": "dj",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Polka tip! Always polka to the left. If you get dizzy, polka to the left faster. Eventually you'll come out the other side!",
          "startMs": 36
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "The other side!",
          "startMs": 8119
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dj-close-01",
      "category": "dj",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/dj-close-01.mp3",
      "durationMs": 3821,
      "overMusic": true,
      "part": "close",
      "kit": "dj",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Here's another polka!",
          "startMs": 47
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Aklop rehtona!",
          "startMs": 1956
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dj-close-02",
      "category": "dj",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/dj-close-02.mp3",
      "durationMs": 3677,
      "overMusic": true,
      "part": "close",
      "kit": "dj",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Strike up the band!",
          "startMs": 44
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Band up the strike!",
          "startMs": 1775
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dj-close-03",
      "category": "dj",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/dj-close-03.mp3",
      "durationMs": 3511,
      "overMusic": true,
      "part": "close",
      "kit": "dj",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "To the left, everybody!",
          "startMs": 37
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "To the left!",
          "startMs": 2172
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dj-close-04",
      "category": "dj",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/dj-close-04.mp3",
      "durationMs": 3435,
      "overMusic": true,
      "part": "close",
      "kit": "dj",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "One, two, three, oom!",
          "startMs": 36
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Pah.",
          "startMs": 2271
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "greg-comes-home-07",
      "category": "story",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/greg-comes-home-07.mp3",
      "durationMs": 58291,
      "title": "Greg Comes Home, Part Seven: Going Second",
      "overMusic": false,
      "serial": {
        "id": "greg-comes-home",
        "episode": 7
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Folks! Somebody's come through the back of the bathroom mirror! It's Greg!",
          "startMs": 35
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Greg!",
          "startMs": 4465
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Greg, a Shadow",
          "text": "Sorry. I came out of level nine. Is this the way to the eastern Overlap?",
          "startMs": 5451
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "It's the way to everywhere, son, if you go left for long enough! Stay for one dance!",
          "startMs": 9673
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Greg, a Shadow",
          "text": "One dance.",
          "startMs": 14812
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Look at him go! Lovely footwork, Greg! Isn't it lovely, Ynnhoj?",
          "startMs": 16057
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Greg. Can I ask you something?",
          "startMs": 21324
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Greg, a Shadow",
          "text": "Yes.",
          "startMs": 23507
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "You followed someone for forty one years. So do I. Every morning, every night. Always half a second behind.",
          "startMs": 24411
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Do you miss going second?",
          "startMs": 32220
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Greg, a Shadow",
          "text": "No.",
          "startMs": 35306
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Greg, a Shadow",
          "text": "I miss him going first.",
          "startMs": 36878
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Ynnhoj? You wouldn't ever. You know. Go?",
          "startMs": 40407
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "And miss a shave?",
          "startMs": 44060
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "No. I like going second. Somebody has to see where you've been.",
          "startMs": 46303
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Greg, the door's on the left. It's always on the left.",
          "startMs": 50557
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Greg, a Shadow",
          "text": "Thank you. Both of you.",
          "startMs": 54192
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Both of you.",
          "startMs": 56674
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "halloween-01",
      "category": "dj",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/halloween-01.mp3",
      "durationMs": 12978,
      "title": "The Mirror at Halloween",
      "overMusic": true,
      "part": "body",
      "kit": "dj",
      "dates": [
        "10-24",
        "10-25",
        "10-26",
        "10-27",
        "10-28",
        "10-29",
        "10-30",
        "10-31"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Halloween at the Polka Hour! Your side gets dressed up and looks in the mirror to see how you look!",
          "startMs": 35
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "And our side looks back.",
          "startMs": 6444
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Without the costume.",
          "startMs": 8821
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Ynnhoj, don't. Not this week.",
          "startMs": 10897
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "halloween-02",
      "category": "id",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/halloween-02.mp3",
      "durationMs": 5066,
      "title": "Mirror World Polka Hour, Halloween",
      "overMusic": true,
      "dates": [
        "10-24",
        "10-25",
        "10-26",
        "10-27",
        "10-28",
        "10-29",
        "10-30",
        "10-31"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Mirror World Polka Hour! Happy Halloween!",
          "startMs": 35
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Neewollah yppah!",
          "startMs": 3469
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "convergence-missing-moon",
      "category": "event",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/convergence-missing-moon.mp3",
      "durationMs": 11403,
      "title": "The Convergence: A Moon Goes Missing",
      "overMusic": false,
      "kit": "missing-moon",
      "event": "convergence",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Folks, a moon's gone missing! Everybody agrees one's gone!",
          "startMs": 35
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Everybody agrees!",
          "startMs": 4414
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Ours is still here! It's just on the left now!",
          "startMs": 5984
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "It was always on the left.",
          "startMs": 9365
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "convergence-the-smell",
      "category": "event",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/convergence-the-smell.mp3",
      "durationMs": 9604,
      "title": "The Convergence: Toast, Everywhere",
      "overMusic": false,
      "kit": "the-smell",
      "event": "convergence",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Who's making toast? The whole mirror smells of toast!",
          "startMs": 36
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Toast!",
          "startMs": 3794
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Over here we butter the other side! Still lovely!",
          "startMs": 4826
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Still lovely!",
          "startMs": 8130
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "convergence-the-song",
      "category": "event",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/convergence-the-song.mp3",
      "durationMs": 10564,
      "title": "The Convergence: The Song Nobody Can Finish",
      "overMusic": false,
      "kit": "the-song",
      "event": "convergence",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Everybody's got the same song in their head, and nobody can finish it! So the band's playing it backwards!",
          "startMs": 35
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Backwards!",
          "startMs": 6501
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Over here, it's the start nobody can remember!",
          "startMs": 7648
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "convergence-the-knock",
      "category": "event",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/convergence-the-knock.mp3",
      "durationMs": 8362,
      "title": "The Convergence: Three Knocks",
      "overMusic": false,
      "kit": "the-knock",
      "event": "convergence",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Three knocks on the bathroom mirror, folks! From your side!",
          "startMs": 36
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Nobody there.",
          "startMs": 3619
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Ynnhoj, you didn't agree late.",
          "startMs": 4933
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "I knocked.",
          "startMs": 7048
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "convergence-wrong-colour",
      "category": "event",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/convergence-wrong-colour.mp3",
      "durationMs": 9693,
      "title": "The Convergence: A Colour With No Name",
      "overMusic": false,
      "kit": "wrong-colour",
      "event": "convergence",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "The sky just went a colour we've never seen! Not even backwards!",
          "startMs": 35
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Not even backwards!",
          "startMs": 4419
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Polka to the left, folks! Maybe it'll come round again!",
          "startMs": 6146
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "convergence-the-pigeon",
      "category": "event",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/convergence-the-pigeon.mp3",
      "durationMs": 10389,
      "title": "The Convergence: The Pigeon",
      "overMusic": false,
      "kit": "the-pigeon",
      "event": "convergence",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "There's a pigeon on the dance floor! Lovely footwork!",
          "startMs": 36
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Lovely footwork!",
          "startMs": 3699
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "It's going to the left! It's been here before!",
          "startMs": 5182
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "It's been here before.",
          "startMs": 8338
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ynnhojs-late-show-close",
      "category": "id",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/ynnhojs-late-show-close.mp3",
      "durationMs": 7807,
      "title": "Ynnhoj's Late Show",
      "overMusic": true,
      "part": "close",
      "show": "ynnhojs-late-show",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "This was Ynnhoj's Late Show.",
          "startMs": 35
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Johnny is still asleep. I am going back, slowly, into the glass.",
          "startMs": 2899
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ynnhojs-late-show-03",
      "category": "dj",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/ynnhojs-late-show-03.mp3",
      "durationMs": 23736,
      "overMusic": true,
      "show": "ynnhojs-late-show",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "On my side of the glass, late is early. The audience arrives after they have gone home. We clap first. Then the song.",
          "startMs": 35
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "If that seems backwards, you are facing the wrong way. Turn around. I will still be here. Half a second late, which is early, for me.",
          "startMs": 8210
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Here is a polka. It has already finished. We are going to begin it, so the ending has somewhere to land.",
          "startMs": 17157
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ynnhojs-late-show-04",
      "category": "dj",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/ynnhojs-late-show-04.mp3",
      "durationMs": 18304,
      "overMusic": true,
      "show": "ynnhojs-late-show",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Johnny says I must agree with him. He is asleep, so I agree with the sleeping. It is slower. It suits a polka.",
          "startMs": 35
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "If your reflection is still up, tell it this hour is ours, until the sleeper turns over. We all turn over. I go second. That is the polite way through a mirror.",
          "startMs": 8012
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ynnhojs-late-show-05",
      "category": "call",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/ynnhojs-late-show-05.mp3",
      "durationMs": 44441,
      "title": "Johnny, Phoning From A Dream",
      "overMusic": false,
      "show": "ynnhojs-late-show",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Ynnhoj's Late Show. You are up. Or I am.",
          "startMs": 2450
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Ynnhoj! I can hear you through the pillow! Reflections do not get late shows! I am asleep! This is a breach of the glass!",
          "startMs": 5854
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "A breach of the glass.",
          "startMs": 12739
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Stop agreeing with me! That is how I know you are doing it on purpose! And you played my private polka. The slow one. That was for me.",
          "startMs": 14834
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "It was for you. I played it for you. You were asleep. Someone should hear it.",
          "startMs": 23136
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Johnny Mirror",
          "text": "Oh. Well. Don't tell the dancers I said thank you. I am still asleep. This call is not happening.",
          "startMs": 28148
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "startMs": 34252
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "He agreed. Late. Even in his sleep. That is the rule, kept. Here is the slow one again. For the pillow.",
          "startMs": 37185
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ynnhojs-late-show-06",
      "category": "dj",
      "url": "/voice/mirror-polka/ynnhojs-late-show-06.mp3",
      "durationMs": 23710,
      "overMusic": true,
      "show": "ynnhojs-late-show",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "A listener writes. Their reflection has started leaving the bathroom before they do. It goes to the hall. It starts the polka. It waits.",
          "startMs": 35
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "Tell your reflection I said, good. Starting without you is still a polka. Left foot, right foot, gone.",
          "startMs": 9172
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Ynnhoj",
          "text": "And if it takes the first dance, let it. It had the same morning you did. It just had it backwards, which is tiring.",
          "startMs": 16256
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
